 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Successive adjoining of etale sections",
 "statement": "Starting with $R_0=R$, let $R_{n+1}$ be the tensor product over $R_n$ of one\nrepresentative of every faithfully flat etale $R_n$-algebra of finite\npresentation. An arbitrary tensor product here means the filtered colimit of\nits finite tensor products, including the empty tensor product $R_n$. Set\n$R^{\\mathrm e}=\\varinjlim_nR_n$. Representatives are chosen in a fixed\nuniverse throughout.",
